# Telos, the arrest (TSL, 201TEL, 202TEL, 203TEL): Lieutenant Grenn meets
# the Ebon Hawk at Dock Module 126 and takes the party into custody (we
# cooperate), the handmaiden steals the ship, the false Batu Rem's attempt
# in the TSF cells (he opens the force cages: a fight), the apartment in
